WEBVTT

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.940
Let us ever remember.

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:49.020
The Shadows are an
outstanding family of nobles.

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:54.190
To serve them is the pride
and joy of every living doll.

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:44.150
Good morning, Mistress Kate.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:48.810
I'm the living doll who will
be serving you starting today.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.310
Your name?

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:52.810
Ma'am?

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.310
You must be given a name.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:56.480
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.650
Katie, Kathy, Kat...

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.810
No, perhaps not.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.060
Maybe later.

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:05.900
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:40.540
The Shadow and Her Doll

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.350
Could you not stare?

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.230
Forgive me!

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:10.230
Kate does not...

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:12.730
Yes, Mistress Kate?

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:15.480
Kate doesn't like
looking people in the eye.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.770
If you looked at their forehead,

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:20.600
wouldn't it seem like you
were looking in their eyes?

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.150
Like this?

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.980
Well, it's not like you can tell.

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:28.150
It looks like you're looking at me.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:30.770
You're just saying that.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:35.900
After all, no one can see a shadow's face.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:38.100
Excuse me, but...

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:42.850
The soot? It emanates due to
anger or other negative emotions.

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:46.100
Are you angry right now?

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:49.400
No. Anxious, perhaps.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.650
Anxious.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:57.690
Soot collects in nooks and crannies.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.230
I had no idea.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:06.520
You are staring again.

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:09.060
That makes Kate more anxious than ever.

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:11.350
Forgive me.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.770
She's anxious.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:26.940
I feel anxious, too, Mistress Kate.

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:36.650
I can't read this.
I can't read any of these.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:41.310
How will I ever be of
service to Mistress Kate?

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:56.230
Forgive me, Mistress Kate!

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:59.150
What's done is done. Just clean it up.

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:01.150
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:02.730
I'm really sorry.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.850
Kate is going to take a bath.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:09.230
Yes, ma'am! I'll finish
cleaning up before you're done!

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:15.100
My body isn't working right.

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:18.980
Can I fix it by applying oil somewhere?

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:29.060
If I break, will I be thrown out, too?

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:31.650
No, no! I'm completely fine!

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:34.270
I am as fit as a fiddle!

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.690
I did it again.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:47.560
It seems dolls feel pain, too.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.690
Clothes are not for cleaning up spills.

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:58.520
You're absolutely right.

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:04.150
But I needed a big cloth.
I don't mind looking like this.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:08.480
Listen. The Shadows family's
living dolls are not mere servants.

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:11.810
They were created to
precisely mimic human beings.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:15.810
Without faces, it's hard to tell the
members of the Shadows family apart.

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:19.310
Living dolls, such as you,
serve as our faces.

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:22.600
As such, we cannot have you
neglecting your appearance.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:25.940
Forgive me for bringing
shame upon your family.

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:30.560
There is so much you don't know,
but you will gradually learn.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.520
Um...

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:32.650
Yes?

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:36.270
I'm a doll someone created, aren't I?

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:37.810
That's right.

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:40.650
Why are we created to look human?

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:44.060
Perhaps because it allows
you to move about, work,

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.980
and serve as our faces.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:48.940
Mistress Kate, are you human?

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:53.060
You ask too many questions.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:55.810
Forgive me.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:03.060
What is it? Are you all right?

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:06.020
I think this might be it for me.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:09.560
I'm broken beyond repair.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.270
My body won't move.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:14.230
I can no longer fulfill my duties.

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:17.770
I wish I could've had more
time with you, Mistress Kate.

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:21.650
This will not do.
Without you, Kate cannot--

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:25.900
Hmm?

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.440
Now my body is making strange sounds.

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:29.690
Have you eaten?

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:32.150
No, I'm a doll.

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:35.060
Food supplies the energy your body needs.

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:37.940
It should be delivered
to your room each day.

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:40.770
Forgive me. It's my first day.
I only ate a tiny bit.

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:42.230
Well, eat more!

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:45.810
I thought the rest was yours,
so I left it on the cabinet.

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:49.060
Wait there. Kate will bring you something.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.900
Mistress Kate...

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:57.900
Wow! Is this all for me?

00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:58.770
It is.

00:11:58.770 --> 00:12:00.980
This is the bread you eat.

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:03.850
It's not like the bread
that's brought to my room.

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:07.600
It's white, and soft,
and so yummy looking!

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:10.400
No! No matter how hungry I am,

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:15.480
I don't want to become a doll so greedy
she'd dare eat her mistress's bread!

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:19.230
You are Kate's face, are you not?

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:21.520
Yes.

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:26.190
Kate would like to see what she looks
like when eating something delicious.

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:28.400
So that's part of my job, too?!

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:30.100
Then I won't hold back!

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.230
Thank you for this bread!

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:38.150
What is it? Does such food
not suit a living doll?

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:39.940
It's so yummy!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.940
How can bread be this good?!

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:45.440
It's so very, very delicious!

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:50.060
Hmm? Mistress Kate, why do
you suddenly seem so merry?

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:54.730
It's quite amusing to see someone
so delighted over some bread.

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:56.810
But it's so delicious!

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:01.980
This is just too yummy!

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:05.020
Don't roll around while you eat!

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.850
Kate is going to bed now.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.810
Thank you for cleaning all day.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:14.400
You're welcome, but I'm afraid
I was nothing but trouble.

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:19.190
I'm so very happy, and I thank you
for bringing me such delicious bread.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:22.020
You're welcome. How do you feel now?

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:24.520
I feel wonderful and full of energy!

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:27.900
You sure are positive, aren't you?

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:31.850
Did you forget already? Don't stare.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:35.520
Forgive me. The thought of not seeing
you till tomorrow made me feel lonely.

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:36.480
Huh?

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:38.980
You're a strange one.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.100
Good night.

00:14:09.270 --> 00:14:11.020
Hmm?

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:25.100
You made a sootman!

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:26.850
How long have you been there?!

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:29.730
From the very start! It's a masterpiece.

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:32.650
It was merely to pass the time.
There's nothing else to do.

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:34.900
You may return to your room if you'd like.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:39.520
No! I enjoy watching you, Mistress Kate!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:44.650
It makes Kate uncomfortable
to be stared at like that.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:49.400
Would you care to play a game of cards?

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.310
May I?!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:58.900
Excuse me. How do you read this one?

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:02.230
I can't read this one or this one, either.

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:14.100
You taught me so much today. I'm so happy!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:17.440
I want to study even more
so I may better serve you.

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:19.690
You're right.

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:23.810
If you get up to clean
an hour earlier tomorrow,

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:27.600
Kate will continue today's lesson.

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:30.730
Hurray! That's wonderful!

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:36.480
Mistress Kate taught me
this letter. This one, too!

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:39.150
So that's how you write this.

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:43.100
It's kind of hard to read.

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:47.980
But I'm sure I'll be able to read
better tomorrow. I can't wait!

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:53.900
I overslept!

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:01.810
Good morning.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.650
Good morning.

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:13.480
You're late.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:17.600
Kate is going to take a bath.
Please clean up this mess.

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:21.650
Yes, ma'am! I will do my best!

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.810
You've made good progress.

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:34.400
Mistress Kate! I could see your face!

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:36.730
Please stay like that a moment.

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:40.100
Perhaps your profile
will tell me how you feel.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:42.900
Please smile.

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:44.400
Like this?

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:48.520
Could you try a big, loud laugh?

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:51.150
Kate's never done that before.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.100
Like this.

00:16:55.060 --> 00:17:00.440
Amazing. Such laughter
with no cause whatsoever.

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:03.810
As you said, profiles are very important.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:05.350
Yes, ma'am!

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.690
I'm done cleaning.

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:12.060
Well done.

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:15.900
You're quite dirty. Go wash up and change.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.190
Then we'll have tea.

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:18.940
Together with you?!

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:21.310
I'll prepare at once!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.060
That's better!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.980
It's almost ready.

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:41.400
You only washed what you
saw in the mirror, didn't you?

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:43.940
What?! Oh, forgive me!

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:47.650
Come here. Let's wipe you off.

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:48.480
I was wondering.

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:53.770
Do all members of the Shadows
family have a living doll like me?

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:55.980
Though the timing differs,

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:59.650
we all get a living doll as
recognition of our coming of age.

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:01.900
Oh, I see.

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:04.270
What is it?

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:08.190
I was wondering. Am I defective?

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:13.190
Mistress Kate, you are so prim
and proper, so utterly unlike me.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:16.900
Will I ever be beautiful?

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:25.600
You can be made more ladylike.

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:29.440
Kate is skilled at
makeovers. Come sit here.

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:33.520
Oh, no, forgive me.
Please forget I ever said that.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:37.310
There's no need to make
a fuss over me. I'll be fine.

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:40.600
Kate wants to play with her doll. Sit.

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:45.350
It's so sparkly!

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:46.560
I wish I had one!

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:51.520
It's a makeup box. You'll look
beautiful if you learn how to use it.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.270
What's this?

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:58.770
Powder for making your face
look pretty. But you don't need it yet.

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:02.770
I just had a wonderful idea!

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:06.900
If you use this, maybe we'll
be able to see your face.

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:09.020
No! Don't!

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:16.520
Forgive the raised voice, but
Kate does not need such things.

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:19.770
I'm sorry. I shouldn't have done that.

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:23.400
After all, I'm your face.

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:27.650
You are Kate's cherished identity.

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:32.770
I'm your identity?
I wonder if I'm serving you well.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:35.150
I will just have to try harder!

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:36.520
Be still.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:38.690
Forgive me.

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:43.480
Maybe we should play dress-up, too.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:46.600
My clothes are in the room
over there. Go try something on.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.190
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:52.600
How do I look?

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:58.440
Actually, it is prohibited to dress up
a living doll in a shadow's clothes.

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:00.350
What?! I'll change at once!

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:06.650
The reason is clear now.
Dolls look like perfect human beings.

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:09.190
That's not true!

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:14.150
I don't notice when I get dirty,
and my behavior is uncouth.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:17.520
Even if I wear a lovely outfit,
I'll end up falling and ruining it.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:22.190
Mistress Kate, you're the one
who made me look like this!

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:25.480
I am your mirror.

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:29.270
See? You're smiling!

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:32.350
Do not presume to control Kate's emotions.

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:34.440
Forgive me! I got carried away!

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:38.310
That wasn't my intent.
I just thought you were smiling.

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:40.440
Oh, but you're not emitting soot.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:44.480
You no longer feel anxious around me.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:46.980
Perhaps you're right.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.150
You just laughed!

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:54.400
It was as plain as day.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:55.440
You know what?

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:56.730
Ma'am?

00:20:56.730 --> 00:21:01.400
You are still in need of a name.
But it is so hard to decide.

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:05.230
One idea is "Emily,"
the heroine of this book.

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:07.350
Emily? How wonderful!

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:09.980
She's positive and cheerful just like you.

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:11.520
I'm so happy!

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:15.900
But you are rather
strange and funny to watch.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:18.520
I'm funny?

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:22.310
How about Emily with
a twist? Maybe "Emilico"?

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:24.560
Emilico.

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:25.690
You don't approve?

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:28.690
No, it's a wonderful name!

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:33.100
Emilico. Starting from today,
I'm Emilico. Hurray!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:36.190
Make us proud, Emilico...

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:37.850
in your own special way.

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:41.690
I'll try my hardest to be of
service to you, Mistress Kate!

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:44.060
Thank you so very much!

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.600
Emilico.

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:54.600
Ma'am?

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:57.310
Isn't that spot outside?

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:59.100
Outside?

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:06.400
I wonder if there are other members
of the Shadows family out there.

00:23:48.730 --> 00:23:51.990
Next episode

00:23:48.730 --> 00:23:51.990
Outside the Room

00:23:48.730 --> 00:23:51.480
Next episode, "Outside the Room."
